<section class="wrap narrow section">
    <h1>About Ashford Hire</h1>
    <p class="lead">Ashford Tool &amp; Plant Hire started in 1994 with three mini diggers and a flatbed in Stourton, Leeds. Thirty years on we run eight depots and a fleet of more than 1,400 machines, still family-owned and still independent.</p>
    <div class="grid grid-3 stats">
        <div class="card"><div class="kpi-value">8</div><div class="muted">depots</div></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="kpi-value">1,400+</div><div class="muted">machines</div></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="kpi-value">96%</div><div class="muted">on-time delivery</div></div>
    </div>
    <h2>Safety first</h2>
    <p>Every machine is inspected before it leaves the yard and carries its service and LOLER records. Operator quick-reference guides can be downloaded from each equipment page.</p>
    <h2>Working with us</h2>
    <p>We're always looking for HGV drivers, fitters and hire desk controllers. Email <a href="mailto:careers@@ashfordhire.co.uk">careers@@ashfordhire.co.uk</a>.</p>
